3733:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h **** /** \brief Force Starts the external Timer.
3734:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  * External Timer(STM,GTM,TSU) have to be initialised first.
