3744:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h **** /** \brief Starts the external Timer.
3745:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  * External Timer(STM,GTM,TSU) have to be initialized first.
3746:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  * Can Node must be configered to select corresponding trigger source along with its configurations
3747:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  * Then call this API to start the external timer.
3748:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  * It will not start if Reset(TIMER.CCR.B.STRESET) is also 1.
